            "push/pop 尾部进出，shift/unshift 头部进出，splice 万能增删插",
            "arr.indexOf(x) 找下标，arr.includes(x) 判存在",
            "数组是引用：b = a 后改 b 会连 a 一起改，拷贝用 [...a]",
          ],
          example: {
            code: `const arr = [1, 2, 3];
arr.push(4);            // [1,2,3,4]
arr.shift();            // [2,3,4]
